            <div xml:id="d576">

                <pb facs="0703" n="601" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg601"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 8183/162–164.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Thompson to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extracts.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-04-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 2,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith a copy of the Diario
                    Oficial of April 1 containing the President’s semiannual message at the opening
                    of the Chamber of Deputies yesterday, and a clipping from the Mexican Herald of
                    today which gives a true English translation thereof.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. E. Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d576-a1.xml" xpointer="d576-a1"/>
            </div>
